Lab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T00:23:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T00:26:07Z","body":"In other words, the point where it crosses the axis.\n\n<img width=\"443\" height=\"346\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82e0be6b-0e10-43cb-8864-cd3c6f90406c\" />\n\nSince the more prominent axis rotation gizmo should take priority, using the outer circle becomes difficult in this situation; Especially in cases where they become closer to the outer circle (meaning plane).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3721370617/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3721376714","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114674#issuecomment-3721376714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114674","id":3721376714,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dz7PK","user":{"login":"caphindsight","id":10833413,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODMzNDEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10833413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight","html_url":"https://github.com/caphindsight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/subscriptions",